LESSON STAGES & TEACHING ACTIVITIES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Phase 1: Starter / Introduction (10 mins)
   - Review previous knowledge and introduce today's new concept using a brief engaging question or demonstration.

2. Phase 2: Main Instruction & Exploration (25 mins)
   - Step-by-step presentation of the concept. Guided practice with students responding to prompts.

3. Phase 3: Assessment / Plenary (10 mins)
   - Quick class quiz, individual seatwork check, or practical demonstration to confirm understanding.

